Z||000009||FieroHeather||08-24-2001||11:17 AM||||I have been working my butt off all summer long--havent had a weekend off since the end of June, and I asked my boss to have the long weekend off in September.  She kept saying that there were TONS of other people asking for that weekend off and that she would "have to see".  I was in suspense for over a week until the schedule was posted last night.<P>After all of that, she DID give me the time off that I requested!  But it was like I had to suck up to her to actually get it off--like I havent worked hard enough already for it!!<P>Now I get to go away and relax before all of my school stuff arrives for me to work on.  *sigh*  <P>ALSO, I needed a particular weekend off for a wedding Im going to on Sept 8th, and she pounded her fist into the counter when I told her that I was unavailable to work that weekend.  It wasnt MY fault that there was a friend's wedding that weekend...what did she want them to do, CHANGE their wedding date??  GRRRR.  <P>I am 97% sure I have that weekend off too--but come on, I work soooooooo hard for that retail company, I need some time off!!<P>So I feel your frustration Lady Pegasus... and I dont like that feeling at all!||||reg||8
Z||000010||8Ball||08-24-2001||11:37 AM||||Oh don't get me started on suck ***'s!!!<BR>Wait you already did, oh well. Where I work,<BR>A computer shop. The store Manager is this 18 year old punk who knows next to nothing about computers. He is still in high school and every single machine he fixes comes back in 2-3 days for me to fix correctly. He is only the manager cause the company owner is boneing his mom. Everyone in the company knows this too. But here is what makes it really bad. He does everything wrong or illegally and I YES I get the friggin blame for it. The customers tell me all the time I am the best tech in the company but yet the little 18 y/o arse has convinced the boss I am the one screwing stuff up. So who get's into trouble?? Who is ABOUT to be fired?? certainly not him, he is a little angel. No let's yell at and threaten the other guy. Let's tell Randy he is about to be fired. Let's dock Randy's pay 80 bucks for a 1.2 processor that the 18 y/o fried and blamed randy for. If I had my way that little sh*t would be out the door and up on criminal charges so fast his head would spin!!!!!<P><BR>Anyone wanna hire a pc tech  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Randy||||reg||1
