Z||000015||sqoach||08-25-2001||02:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever3000:<BR><B> [QUOTE]After all of that, she DID give me the time off that I requested!<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>And from my experience, Supe's like that will keep bringing that up like you owe them something for doing it!  "Remember that time you begged for the time off and I gave it to you?" <P></B>[/QUOTE]<P>I know what you mean! I hate that! My last two jobs only lasted about 3 months each. I can't handle that sh!t. They think they can push me around. I step in for them when they need me to work for them, but they can't seem to do the same for me. They just <I>expect</I> me to do it. Then they'll ask again, assuming I'll say yes. WTF?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><BR>And they did some stupid ****  to make me quit too. I worked at a Homeland in town, near the end of the school year my senior year. They schedule me to work on my <I>graduation day!</I> How stupid can you be!? And it's not like he didn't know. Graduation is always at the same time of the year. I don't live in a big town, so everyone knows about it. He knows how old I am. Anyway, I didn't work on that day, I quit. The other job they try to work me all but two days of the 2 weeks around Christmas. That was total  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"><P>Well, there's my rant. I need a job  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <P>84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR>86 SC (FOR SALE)<BR>86 SE V6 (new project)||||reg||1
