minal charges so fast his head would spin!!!!!<P><BR>Anyone wanna hire a pc tech     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Randy</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>[This message has been edited by Fierowrecker (edited 08-25-2001).]<p>[This message has been edited by Fierowrecker (edited 08-25-2001).]||||reg||1
